{"4889940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Door", "steam_appid": 4889940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889940/extras/e44ba46473f09bcf16e0a10da286ca86.avif?t=1785041804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889940/extras_big/e44ba46473f09bcf16e0a10da286ca86.avif?t=1785041804 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robert wakes up to find himself trapped in a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to escape is to find the <strong>Red Door</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, what awaits him beyond it is the past he has tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To confront his past, Robert ventures deeper into the dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What lies beyond the Red Door? And what truth is hidden within Robert’s past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Door</strong> is a <strong>story-driven first-person horror adventure game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Robert and journey through the dream while reliving his memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889940/extras/5e4b9c51b227c19312722ec388274c8b.avif?t=1785041804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889940/extras_big/5e4b9c51b227c19312722ec388274c8b.webp?t=1785041804 width=1560 height=653 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area contains diaries written by various characters, as well as fragments of Robert’s memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By reading these diaries, you’ll uncover Robert’s past and learn what happened in each location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area also features its own beautiful scenery and original music.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889940/extras/e44ba46473f09bcf16e0a10da286ca86.avif?t=1785041804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889940/extras_big/e44ba46473f09bcf16e0a10da286ca86.avif?t=1785041804 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robert wakes up to find himself trapped in a dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to escape is to find the <strong>Red Door</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, what awaits him beyond it is the past he has tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To confront his past, Robert ventures deeper into the dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What lies beyond the Red Door? And what truth is hidden within Robert’s past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Door</strong> is a <strong>story-driven first-person horror adventure game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Robert and journey through the dream while reliving his memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889940/extras/5e4b9c51b227c19312722ec388274c8b.avif?t=1785041804\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889940/extras_big/5e4b9c51b227c19312722ec388274c8b.webp?t=1785041804 width=1560 height=653 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area contains diaries written by various characters, as well as fragments of Robert’s memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By reading these diaries, you’ll uncover Robert’s past and learn what happened in each location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each area also features its own beautiful scenery and original music.</p>", "short_description": "The Door is a first-person horror adventure game. To escape from a dream, the protagonist must confront his past and continue moving forward. What lies beyond the red door? And what truth is hidden within the protagonist’s past?", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889940/e5b1b268fdb85f2f85055ced618728474b8fee6c/header.jpg?t=1785041804", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889940/b68d6a1635af6d5890a37cadb76d2fab05b99f12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785041804", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889940/b68d6a1635af6d5890a37cadb76d2fab05b99f12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785041804", "website": "https://star2020game.com/works/games/the-door/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</